Measurement guide diagrams
==========================

Layout (gender-specific; resolved from profile ``User.sex``):

  male/{neck,chest,waist,hips,biceps,thigh,calf,shoulder_girdle,overview}.png
  female/{…same…}.png

Fallback: if profile sex is unset, guides use the ``male`` folder
(onboarding normally sets sex first).

``overview_source.png`` — inspiration only (FB/VK-style bodybuilder chart with
labels). Served overviews are restyled originals:
  male/overview.png and female/overview.png
(no vk.com/bicepsclub watermark). Layout inspired by that diagram; assets are
project-authored.

Per-site cards: instructional photos with unified chrome
(dark-navy footer, yellow circle + ruler icon, yellow «одно число в см»).
Overviews use the same chrome family with footer «выбери точку».

Gender pipeline rule: regenerator never copies male↔female. Staging filenames
must be prefixed ``male_`` / ``female_``.

License: project-authored instructional illustrations / restyled cards (CC0 1.0
for chrome and project originals). Source diagram is inspiration only.

Regenerate / restamp (dev machine, Pillow not a runtime dependency):

  uv run --with pillow python scripts/generate_measurement_guide_images.py
